WEBVTT

00:01.400 --> 00:07.000
There is one man who can help us secure the proof: Guo Xuan, son of the Governor of Qing Province.

00:11.840 --> 00:17.500
The Prince of Jin saved his life; he might be willing to obtain the original Qing Province ledgers for us.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
I shall depart immediately to seek him out!
